sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant CDN
    participant API
    participant Auth
    participant DB
    participant Cache
    participant Queue

    User->>Browser: Click Login
    Browser->>CDN: Load Login Page
    CDN-->>Browser: HTML/CSS/JS

    User->>Browser: Enter Credentials
    Browser->>API: POST /auth/login
    API->>Auth: Validate Token

    alt Invalid Credentials
        Auth-->>API: 401 Unauthorized
        API-->>Browser: Error Response
        Browser-->>User: Show Error
    else Valid Credentials
        Auth->>DB: Query User
        DB-->>Auth: User Record
        Auth->>Cache: Store Session
        Auth-->>API: JWT Token
        API-->>Browser: Set Cookie
        Browser-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard
    end

    User->>Browser: Request Dashboard
    Browser->>API: GET /dashboard
    API->>Cache: Check Session
    Cache-->>API: Session Valid
    API->>DB: Fetch User Data
    DB-->>API: User Data
    API->>Queue: Log Activity
    API-->>Browser: Dashboard Data
    Browser-->>User: Render Dashboard
